{"sections":[{"slug":"直觉主义逻辑","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"直觉主义逻辑"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">直觉主义逻辑</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"直觉主义逻辑"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">直觉主义逻辑</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">又称</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">构造主义逻辑</span></strong> (constructive logic), <span lang=\"zh\">其核心观念是</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">要接受一个命题为真</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">必须给出它的一个例子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">要证明</span> $p \\lor q$ ($p$ <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $q$) <span lang=\"zh\">为真</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">必须要么证明</span> $p$, <span lang=\"zh\">要么证明</span> $q$. <span lang=\"zh\">一个重要的后果是我们不能在不了解一个命题</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">的前提下接受</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/排中律","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">排中律</span>"}},{"Plain":" $p \\lor \\neg p$, <span lang=\"zh\">因为我们可能既不能证明</span> $p$, <span lang=\"zh\">也不能证明</span> $\\neg p$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">要证明</span> $\\exists x P(x)$, <span lang=\"zh\">必须给出一个具体的</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $P(x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的证明</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">模型</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">直觉主义命题演算的模型</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴语义","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴语义</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Heyting代数","text":"Heyting <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">不可证命题列表</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注意</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如下命题在直觉主义逻辑中不能证明</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但这</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">意味着它们的否定为真</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">排中律</span> $p\\lor\\neg p$</li>\n<li>de Morgan <span lang=\"zh\">律</span> $\\neg (p\\land q) \\Rightarrow (\\neg p \\lor \\neg q)$</li>\n<li></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}